/E (Jocelyn Wickett \(she/her\) is a trained theatre artist, who has been working for the Toronto District School Board for almost 20 years as a teacher. She teaches secondary English and Drama, and co-directs the specialized Musical Theatre Production Program at Don Mills Collegiate. Jocelyn also has her MA from U of T with a focus on the arts and equity in education and continues to work on equity initiatives and programming through the arts in her school. Jocelyn is a mom to twin boys, a lover of mountains and rivers, and all things adventure.)
/Pg 14 0 R
